{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31592","headline":"送隐者归罗浮 · 李羣玉","name":"送隐者归罗浮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春山杳杳日迟迟，路入云峰白犬随。\n两卷素书留贳酒，一柯樵斧坐看棋。\n蓬莱道士飞霞履，清远仙人寄好诗。\n自此尘寰音信断，山川风月永相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}